{
  "name": "MCU Pinout Explorer",
  "short_name": "MCU Pinout E",
  "description": "Interactive pinout explorer for ESP32 DevKit, Raspberry Pi Pico (RP2040) and STM32 Blue Pill. Hover or filter pins by ADC, PWM, I2C, SPI, UART and see strapping and boot pin warnings. Runs in your browser.",
